*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
*  ADSC DIALOG DEFINITION      ASSIGN COMPANY CAR
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD DIALOG FLEASGN VERSION 1
    DESCRIPTION IS 'ASSIGN COMPANY CAR'
    SUBSCHEMA IS FLEETSS1 OF SCHEMA FLEETSCH VERSION 1
    MAP IS FLEASGNM VERSION 1
    WORK RECORD IS FLEWORK
    PREMAP PROCESS IS FLEASGN-PREMAP
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEASGN-ENTER  RESPONSE KEY IS ENTER
       EXECUTE ON EDIT ERRORS
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEASGN-PF3    RESPONSE KEY IS PF3
    .
